{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":503704,"name":"TG Promo","username":"TG_Promo","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/f05b48/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-29T19:49:13.552Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBug in Grok Bot / Sand GenerateImage path.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GenerateImage tool schema accepts aspect_ratio (1:1, 4:3, 3:4, 16:9, 9:16). The tool parses the per-call value and passes it as the 5th argument into generateImageService. But createSandGenerateImageService is declared with only 4 parameters (_ctx, description, _filePath, referenceImages) and never forwards aspect_ratio into createSandImageGenerator / RunGenerateImageRequest.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResult: every generation comes back as JPEG 1280×720 (16:9), even when the agent requests 9:16, 3:4, or 1:1. Files are saved with a .png name but are JFIF/JPEG bytes. C2PA metadata identifies the producer as “Grok Imagine”.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe need true vertical 720×1280 (9:16) for social punch images. Prompt wording and retries do not fix this. Please forward aspect_ratio through createSandGenerateImageService into the cloud RPC.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRepro:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCall GenerateImage with aspect_ratio: “9:16” (also tried “1:1” and “3:4”).\u003cbr\u003e\nInspect output with ffprobe / file magic.\u003cbr\u003e\nObserve width×height always 1280×720, JPEG magic FF D8, C2PA agent “Grok Imagine”.\u003cbr\u003e\nRelated: Cursor has previously tracked fixed-resolution / dropped aspect issues for image generation. This Sand agent path still drops the ratio locally before the request leaves the box.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Grok Bot, ask the agent to call GenerateImage with aspect_ratio: “9:16” (also try “1:1” and “3:4”).\u003cbr\u003e\nOpen the saved asset and inspect with ffprobe / file magic.\u003cbr\u003e\nObserve width×height is always 1280×720, JPEG magic FF D8, C2PA producer “Grok Imagine”, even though the file name ends in .png.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot (Sand) — GenerateImage via createSandGenerateImageService\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot agent (GenerateImage → Grok Imagine backend)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo client Request ID exposed in Grok Bot chat UI for this tool call.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoot cause found in local sand-host: createGenerateImageTool passes aspect_ratio as 5th arg, but createSandGenerateImageService ignores it and never sets aspectRatio on RunGenerateImageRequest. Blocks true 720×1280 vertical social creatives.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-29T19:49:19.824Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":25.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":173363,"topic_slug":"generateimage-accepts-aspect-ratio-but-sand-drops-it-always-returns-1280x720-jpeg","display_username":"TG Promo","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140293,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/generateimage-accepts-aspect-ratio-but-sand-drops-it-always-returns-1280x720-jpeg/173363/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_v